{"parse": {"title": "Oob", "pageid": 6524, "revid": 310173, "redirects": [], "text": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-stacked\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\"><div class=\"infobox2-slideshow dlc-slideshow\"><div class=\"infobox2-slide\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"O\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/1/1b/Font_TeamMeat_O.png/revision/latest?cb=20210822055800\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"28\" height=\"26\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Font TeamMeat O.png\" data-image-key=\"Font_TeamMeat_O.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></span></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"o\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/e/e3/Font_TeamMeat_o.png/revision/latest?cb=20210822060902\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"15\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Font TeamMeat o.png\" data-image-key=\"Font_TeamMeat_o.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></span></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"b\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/a/ac/Font_TeamMeat_b.png/revision/latest?cb=20210822060349\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"17\" height=\"15\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Font TeamMeat b.png\" data-image-key=\"Font_TeamMeat_b.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></span></span></span></div></div></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Entity Image</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><div class=\"infobox2-slideshow dlc-slideshow\"><div class=\"infobox2-slide\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><s