ta-source=\"base hp\">Base HP</h3>\n            \n                <h3 class=\"pi-smart-data-label pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" style=\"width: calc(1 / 2 * 100%);\" data-source=\"stage hp\">Stage HP</h3>\n            \n        </section>\n    \n    <section class=\"pi-smart-group-body pi-border-color\">\n        \n            <div class=\"pi-smart-data-value pi-data-value pi-font pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" style=\"width: calc(1 / 2 * 100%);\" data-source=\"base hp\"><div class=\"infobox2-slideshow dlc-slideshow\"><div class=\"infobox2-slide\"> <span class=\"pi-custom-font\">20</span></div></div></div>\n        \n            <div class=\"pi-smart-data-value pi-data-value pi-font pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" style=\"width: calc(1 / 2 * 100%);\" data-source=\"stage hp\"><div class=\"infobox2-slideshow dlc-slideshow\"><div class=\"infobox2-slide\"> <span class=\"pi-custom-font\">6</span></div></div></div>\n        \n    </section>\n</section>\n\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"id\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Entity ID</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><code>225.0</code></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"environment\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Found In</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sheol\" title=\"Sheol\"><img alt=\"Stage Sheol icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Stage Sheol icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Stage_Sheol_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/7/71/Stage_Sheol_icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20210826073042\" /></a></span><br /><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dark_Room\" title=\"Dark Room\"><img alt=\"Stage Dark Room icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Stage Dark Room icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Stage_Dark_Room_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/6/60/Stage_Dark_Room_icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20210826072941\" /></a></span><br /><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Challenge_Room\" title=\"Challenge Room\"><img alt=\"Challenge Room Icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"27\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Challenge Room Icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Challenge_Room_Icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/1/1b/Challenge_Room_Icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20210821102142\" /></a></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Devil_Room\" title=\"Devil Room\"><img alt=\"Devil Room Icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"27\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Devil Room Icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Devil_Room_Icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/b/b8/Devil_Room_Icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20210822040557\" /></a></span></div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Black Maws</b> behave like Oob but spawns &#32;<span class=\"inline-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Leech_(Enemy)#Leech\" title=\"Leech (Enemy)\"><img alt=\"Leech\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"12\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Leech.png\" data-image-key=\"Leech.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/3/32/Leech.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20210821094038\" /></a></span><a href=\"/wiki/Leech_(Enemy)#Leech\" title=\"Leech (Enemy)\">Leeches</a> instead. If Isaac lines up horizontal to it, it very quickly charges in his direction and then doubles back, charging back to its original position. It explodes upon death. \n</p><p>While in normal rooms Black Maws will generally charge off-screen before returning, in long horizontal rooms they can charge a random distance before returning rather than having to fly out of the room first, this can also happen if they make contact with another enemy.\n</p><p>Unlike the Oob, Black Maws can still summon Leeches regardless of whether they are over an obstruction or not, due to the fact that Leeches can fly.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<ul><li>They can spawn in unique <span class=\"inline-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Devil Room\"><img alt=\"Devil Room\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"18\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Devil Room Icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Devil_Room_Icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/b/b8/Devil_Room_Icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20210822040557\" /></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Devil_Room\" title=\"Devil Room\">Devil Room</a> layouts if Isaac is holding the <span class=\"mw-default-size dlc dlc-8\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Added in Repentance\"><img alt=\"(in Repentance)\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Dlc r indicator.png\" data-image-key=\"Dlc_r_indicator.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/f/f2/Dlc_r_indicator.png/revision/latest?cb=20210815090252\" /></span></span> <span class=\"tooltip\" data-tooltip=\"t/tooltip&#124;Number+Magnet&#124;8\"><span class=\"inline-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Number_Magnet\" title=\"Number Magnet\"><img alt=\"Number Magnet\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Trinket Number Magnet icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Trinket_Number_Magnet_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/6/61/Trinket_Number_Magnet_icon.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20210825164917\" /></a></span><a href=\"/wiki/Number_Magnet\" title=\"Number Magnet\">Number Magnet</a></span>.</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:both\"></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-traditional\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px; height: 150px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/6/6a/Edmund_McMillen_Rebirth_Monster_Sketches.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20200820165725\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Sketches of monsters for the Binding of Isaac: Rebirth, including what appears to be an early design of the Oob and Black Maw in the fourth rectangle of the fourth row and the fifth rectangle of the fourth row, respectively.\"><img alt=\"Sketches of monsters for the Binding of Isaac: Rebirth, including what appears to be an early design of the Oob and Black Maw in the fourth rectangle of the fourth row and the fifth rectangle of the fourth row, respectively.\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"90\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Edmund McMillen Rebirth Monster Sketches.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Edmund_McMillen_Rebirth_Monster_Sketches.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/6/6a/Edmund_McMillen_Rebirth_Monster_Sketches.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/120?cb=20200820165725\" /></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\"> Sketches of monsters for the Binding of Isaac: Rebirth, including what appears to be an early design of the Oob and Black Maw in the fourth rectangle of the fourth row and the fifth rectangle of the fourth row, respectively.</div>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px; height: 150px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/7/78/Last_Will_Oob.png/revision/latest?cb=20210822042137\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"An Oob on Isaac&#39;s Last Will.\"><img alt=\"An Oob on Isaac&#39;s Last Will.\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"109\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Last Will Oob.png\" data-image-key=\"Last_Will_Oob.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/7/78/Last_Will_Oob.png/revision/latest?cb=20210822042137\" /></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\"> An Oob on Isaac's Last Will.</div>\n\t\t</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Oob and Black Maw are both enemies from one of Edmund McMillen's previous games named <i><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Super_Meat_Boy\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:Super Meat Boy\">Super Meat Boy</a></i>.\n<ul><li>Oobs have a different, but a somewhat similiar design. These extremely slowly float towards Meat Boy, but become much faster when Meat Boy is close enough to them.</li>\n<li>In <i>Super Meat Boy</i>, Black Maws work like a homing projectile that breaks into 9 smaller projectiles on impact. They appear from a black hole.</li></ul></li>\n<li>Oobs and Black Maws are the only non-boss enemies that can charge off-screen.\n<ul><li>Black Maws specifically are also the only monsters that double back after charging off-screen, making them unique.</li></ul></li>\n<li><span class=\"mw-default-size dlc dlc-7\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Removed in Repentance\"><img alt=\"(except in Repentance)\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Dlc nr indicator.png\" data-image-key=\"Dlc_nr_indicator.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/0/04/Dlc_nr_indicator.png/revision/latest?cb=20241126195308\" /></span></span>  Rerolling <a href=\"/wiki/Gaping_Maw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Gaping Maw\">Gaping Maws</a> with <span class=\"tooltip\" data-tooltip=\"i/tooltip&#124;D10&#124;15\"><span class=\"inline-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/D10\" title=\"D10\"><img alt=\"Collectible D10 icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Collectible D10 icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Collectible_D10_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/e/e5/Collectible_D10_icon.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20210821041724\" /></a></span><a href=\"/wiki/D10\" title=\"D10\">D10</a></span> always turns them into Oobs.</li>\n<li>Black Maws look surprisingly similar to the xenomorph's mouths from the <i>Alien</i> movies, but this could also be a coincidence.\n<ul><li>It also slightly resembles a sperm cell.</li></ul></li>\n<li><span class=\"mw-default-size dlc dlc-7\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Removed in Repentance\"><img alt=\"(except in Repentance)\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Dlc nr indicator.png\" data-image-key=\"Dlc_nr_indicator.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/0/04/Dlc_nr_indicator.png/revision/latest?cb=20241126195308\" /></span></span>  Oobs have the highest health of any non-boss enemy.</li>\n<li>Oob's name is \"boo\" backwards.</li></ul>\n<p><br class=\"content-filter-end\" /></p><div class=\"nav-start\" style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n<table class=\"nav-box nav-main\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th class=\"nav-title\"><span class=\"no-alt\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"SmallIsaac\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"SmallIsaac.png\" data-image-key=\"SmallIsaac.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/a/a6/SmallIsaac.png/revision/latest?cb=20210821194340\" /></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Binding_of_Isaac:_Rebirth_Wiki\" title=\"Binding of Isaac: Rebirth Wiki\">The Binding of Isaac: Rebirth</a><span class=\"no-alt\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"SmallI